  <description>
    <p>
      StageVibe is an open-source agentic IDE that combines browsing,
      debugging, editing and AI agent workflows in a single application.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Built-in coding agent with browser and filesystem tools</li>
      <li>Integrated editor, terminal and file tree</li>
      <li>Bring your own model provider (local or cloud)</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
